        {
          "text": "Alimwi ndakaswiilila ijwi lizwa kujulu, lyakali mbuli ijwi lyamaanzi manjimanji ambuli muzumo mupati. Elyo ijwi ndindakamvwa lyakali mbuli ijwi lyabasituntimbwa mbubalizya tuntimbwa twabo. ",
