        {
          "text": "Nkabela bakaimba mbuli lwiimbo lupya kunembo lyacuuno cabwami akunembo lyabanyama bone alyabapati, Olo lwiimbo katakwe muntu iwakali kukonzya kulwiiya pele abo bantu balike bali zyuulu zili mwaanda amakumi one azine ibakanununwa kuzwa ansi. ",
