        {
          "text": "Mbimbabo ibatakalisofwaazya kubanakazi, nkaambo mbanabutema. Mbimbabo batobela Mwanambelele koonse nkwaya. Mbimbabo bakasaanguna kunununwa akati kabantu, kuti babe kabalwebalwe ba-Leza aba-Mwanambelele, ",
