        {
          "text": "Lino ndakabona angelo umbi uuluka mujulu, wakalijisi Makani Mabotu aateeli aakukambaukila kulibaabo ibakala ansi akubamasi boonse akumisyobo yoonse akumyaambo yoonse akumikowa yoonse. ",
