        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo kwakazwa angelo umbi muntempele, wakalila ajwi ipati kwaambila oyo iwakakede atala akumbi, wakati, Tola cigonsyo cako, utalike kutebula, nkaambo ciindi cakutebula casika, ikuti maila oonse aanyika abizwa. ",
          "type": "text",
